$DATUM 58. A solution of 57 (2.0 mg, 1.34 μmol) in DMF (224 μL, 0.006 M) was
treated with freshly dried CsF (20.4 mg, 134 μmol, 100 equiv) at 10
°C,"and the reaction mixture was stirred for 24 h at 10 °C. The reaction
mixture was diluted with EtOAc (1 mL) and quenched with the'addition of
saturated aqueous NH4Cl (1 mL) and extracted with EtOAc (2 x 1 mL). The
combined organic phases were washed with saturated aqueous NaCl (2 mL),
dried (Na2SO4) and concentrated in vacuo. PTLC (SO2, 3 x 5% CH3OH-CH2Cl2)
afforded 58 (1.5 mg, 2.0 mg theoretical, 76%) as a white powder. mp 130
°C (dec.); [α]25D +56 (c 0.06, CH3OH); 1H NMR (CD3OD, 400 MHz) δ 7.95 (s,
1H), 7.68-7.63 (m, 2H), 7.57 (d, J = 8.5 Hz, 5H), 7.22 (dd, J = 1.8, 6.4
Hz, 1H), 7.18 (m, 2H), 7.12-7.01 (m, 5H), 6.98 (d, J = 2.0 Hz, 1H), 6.93
(d, J = 2.0 Hz, 1H), 6.67 (d, J = 2.0 Hz, 1H), 6.49 (t, J = 2.1 Hz, 1H),
6.26 (s, 1H), 6.14 (s, 1H), 5.82 (s, 1H), 5.65 (s, 1H), 5.49 (s, 1H),
5.22 (s, 1H), 5.13 (s, 1H), 4.96 (s, 1H), 4.77 (s, 2H), 4.59 (s, 1H),
4.37 (q, J = 4.4 Hz, 1H), 4.14 (s, 3H), 4.07 (br s, 2H), 3.95-3.92 (m,
2H), 3.90 (s, 3H), 3.79 (s, 3H), 3.73 (s, 5H), 3.69(s, 3H),3.59(t, J
=4.4Hz,2H),3.38 (s,3H),3.31(s ,3H),2.97(s,2H), 1.47(s,9H); IR (film) Vmm
3277,2929,2857, 1721,1675, 1643, 1608, 1582, 1526, 1516, 1458, 1432,
1316, 1259, 1228, 1198, 1157, 1090, 1054, 1023 cm-1; MALDIFTMS (DHB) m/z
1489.4568 (M+ + Na, C73H75ClN8O23 requires 1489.4526).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
