$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Preparation of
3-bromo-5-(4-fluorophenoxy)-4'-(trifluoromethyl)-1,1'-biphenyl, 7 4ho
(1.0 equiv, 95.0 mg, 0.30 mmol) was added to a suspension of t-BuOK (1.1
equiv, 38.4 mg, 0.33 mmol) in THF (1.5 mL) at 0 °C and the reaction was
stirred at this temperature for 15 min. After this time,
bis(4-fluorophenyl)iodonium triflate (1.2 equiv, 168 mg, 0.36 mmol) was
added in one portion and the reaction was stirred at 40 °C for 16 h. The
crude material was concentrated in vacuo and purified by flash
chromatography (hexanes).
3-bromo-5-(4-fluorophenoxy)-4'-(trifluoromethyl)- 1,1'-biphenyl (7) as a
colorless oil (92 mg, 75%). IR: 2935, 2362, 1710, 1503, 1328, 1207, 839
cm-1. 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.69 (d, J = 8.2 Hz, 2H), 7.62 (d, J =
8.1 Hz, 2H), 7.45 (t, J = 1.6 Hz, 1H), 7.13-7.03 (m, 6H) ppm. 13C NMR
(101 MHz, CDCl3) δ 159.4 (d, J = 239.5 Hz), 159.2, 151.7, 143.0, 142.6,
130.3 (q, J = 32.6 Hz), 127.4, 125.9 (q, J = 3.8 Hz), 124.9, 124.1 (q, J
= 272.1 Hz), 123.5, 121.3 (d, J = 8.4 Hz), 120.4, 116.7 (d, J = 23.4 Hz),
115.6 ppm. HRMS: calcd for C19H12BrF4O, 411.0002 (M+H+); found, 411.0003.
