$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 1-Ethynyl-4-(p-tolyloxy)benzene (2a). In a reaction flask under Ar, 1a
(125 mg, 1.04 mmol), p-cresol (127 mg, 1.17 mmol), and DMSO (3 mL) were
added. The reaction was started with the addition of KOtBu (129 mg, 1.15
mmol). The reaction mixture was stirred in an oil bath at 100 &#x00B0;C
for 12 h. The reaction was quenched by dilution with CH2Cl2 and 1 M HCl.
The layers were separated, and the aqueous phase was extracted with
CH2Cl2 (3 × 80 mL). The combined organic layers were washed with H2O (80
mL) and dried over Na2SO4. The solvent was carefully removed in vacuo to
give a brown oil (the product is somewhat volatile). Purification by
silica gel flash chromatography (hexanes → CH2Cl2/hexanes, 1/5) gave 2a.
Clear, colorless, viscous liquid, yield 163 mg (0.782 mmol, 75%). 1H NMR
(500 MHz, CDCl3): &#x3B4; 7.43 (d, J = 8.9 Hz, 2H), 7.16 (d, J = 8.1 Hz,
2H), 6.93 (d, J = 8.5 Hz, 2H), 6.90 (d, J = 8.9 Hz, 2H), 3.02 (s, 1H),
2.35 (s, 3H). 13C NMR (126 MHz, CDCl3): &#x3B4; 158.6, 153.7, 133.7,
133.7, 130.4, 119.7, 117.7, 116.1, 83.3, 76.3, 20.7. TLC: Rf = 0.26
(CH2Cl2/hexanes, 1/10). IR (CH2Cl2) 3287 (m), 3038 (w), 2923 (w), 2108
(w), 1895 (w), 1773 (w), 1598 (m), 1508 (m), 1493 (s), 1413 (w), 1380
(w), 1279 (m), 1235 (s), 1208 (m), 1166 (m), 1103 (m), 1043 (w), 1016 (m)
cm-1. HRMS (DART): calcd for [C15H12OH]+ 209.0961, found 209.0966
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM chemoselective
