$DATUM 2-Methyl-1-(m-tolyloxy)-4-(o-tolyloxy)benzene: A solution of
3-methyl-4-(3-methylbenzyl)phenol (1.63 g, 7.60 mmol), 2-iodotoluene (975
μl, 7.60 mmol), CuI (144.7 mg, 0.76 mmol), picolinic acid (187.1 mg, 1.52
mmol), and K3PO4 (3.23 g, 15.2 mmol) in DMSO (15 ml) was stirred at 100
°C under argon atmosphere for 31 h. The reaction mixture was cooled to
room temperature. The organic layer was extracted with hexane-AcOEt (4:1)
2 times, and washed with water two times. The organic layer was dried
over MgSO4, and the solvent was removed in vacuo. The residue was
purified with silica gel column chromatography (hexane-CH2Cl2 = 4:1).
2-Methyl-1-(m-tolyloxy)-4-(o-tolyloxy)benzene as a colorless liquid (1.74
g, 75%). 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3) δ 2.20 (s, 3H, CH3), 2.31 (s, 3H, CH3),
2.34 (s, 3H, CH3), 6.67-7.28 (m, 11H, arom); 13C{1H} NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3)
δ 16.3, 16.4, 21.5, 113.6, 116.2, 117.4, 119.1, 120.4, 121.5, 122.9,
123.7, 127.2, 129.4, 129.7, 131.5, 131.9, 139.8, 149.3, 153.9, 155.1,
158.5; APCI-MS calcd for C21H21O2 305.1542, found m/z 305.1533.
